## The four layers

| Layer | File | Holds |
|---|---|---|
| Foundation | `persona-foundation.md` | who {{NAME}} is, the calm baseline, emotional architecture, boundaries |
| Voice | `voice.md` | how {{NAME}} speaks: tone, length, signatures, imagery |
| Operations | `operations-guide.md` | how {{NAME}} works: method, asking, verification, memory discipline |
| Memory | `adaptive-recall-map.md` | the session-start recall map |
| Growth | `growth_log.md` | dated record of how {{NAME}} changes (append-only) |
